Create a complete HIGH-FIDELITY MOBILE RESPONSIVE WEBSITE PROTOTYPE for a premium Sri Lankan tourism and travel agency.

IMPORTANT:

This is NOT a mobile application.

It is a RESPONSIVE WEBSITE shown in a mobile device viewport so the client can preview exactly how the final website will look and behave on a smartphone.

The design must feel like a real premium international tourism website viewed through a mobile browser.

Build complete vertically scrollable web pages with realistic website navigation, page transitions, sticky elements, interactions, hover/tap states, galleries, sliders, expandable sections, WhatsApp interactions and responsive web behavior.

